  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c5mPS5M.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/STpZLUv.jpeg\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Ribbits 将会&nbsp;添加充满名为 Ribbits 的微小青蛙村民的沼泽村庄！<br>这些小家伙有时会聚在一起演奏音乐，你也可以加入其中！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;商人&nbsp;和渔夫 Ribbits 可以用各种物品进行交换，包括全新的 Ribbits 植物方块与沙锤！<br>法师 Ribbits 会偶尔施放法术来增益玩家，&nbsp;而&nbsp;所有园丁 Ribbits 都会为作物浇水！&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Ribbits 在夜晚会自然返回家中，但如果你想搬迁它们，你可以使用&nbsp;紫水晶&nbsp;右键点击它们，将其家点重置为当前位置。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美术<br>yungnickyoung - 编程<br>HellionGames - 编程<br>scratchy_sd - 音效<br>wesleybenjamin - 音乐<br>joakota - 建筑<br>joshesque - Logo<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creatures and Beasts</a></strong>&nbsp;- 一款向 Minecraft 中添加奇妙生物的模组！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters and Companions</a></strong> - 一款添加多种友善动物的模组！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ghost</a></strong> - 为你的世界添加两只友善的幽灵生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nightlights\" rel=\"nofollow\">Night Lights</a></strong>&nbsp;- 添加了大量不同种类的装饰性光源！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lookin' Sharp</a></strong>&nbsp;- 为游戏添加了 60 种新的近战武器！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 一款全面重构原版苦力怕的模组！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderman Overhaul</a></strong> - 一款全面重构原版末影人的模组！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golem Overhaul</a> </strong>- 一款添加了 9 种新傀儡类型的模组！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BLLNBwE.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CgpcwIt.png\"></p>",
